+# Sample App
+
+A small notes API. It is the application that the DevSecOps pipeline builds, tests, scans and
+deploys to the Docker sandbox.
+
+## Endpoints
+
+| Method | Path | Description |
+|---|---|---|
+| GET | `/health` | Liveness check, polled by the Monitoring Agent after a deploy |
+| GET | `/notes` | List all notes |
+| POST | `/notes` | Create a note (`title` is required, `body` is optional) |
+| GET | `/notes/{id}` | Fetch one note |
+| DELETE | `/notes/{id}` | Delete one note |
+
+## Run it locally
+
+```bash
+pip install -r requirements.txt
+uvicorn app.main:app --port 8080
+```
+
+Then open http://localhost:8080/docs for the interactive API documentation.
+
+## Run the tests
+
+```bash
+python -m pytest --cov=app
+```
+
+Notes are kept in memory, so they are gone when the process restarts.
